combat and a gritty storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969440/extras/f3f8f8344d6bf19c44805f51372a73b3.poster.avif?t=1762785219\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969440/extras/f3f8f8344d6bf19c44805f51372a73b3.webm?t=1762785219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969440/extras/f3f8f8344d6bf19c44805f51372a73b3.mp4?t=1762785219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
